5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think we should be careful about how these programs are sustained. I'll look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I want to see if previous efforts actually worked. I'll check the readmission figures during the call-back trial and what the booking system records.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Staffing is always the bottleneck. I will examine the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm interested in the financial reality. I'll check this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the physical capacity of our hospital. I'll look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage and the data agreements with outside surgeries.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
